note Pure seeded OM-2 ionic-droplet reservoir CPU reference and binary64 ridge
note readout (omega#440, Gate 1). Replaces src/reservoir/omega_reservoir.{c,h}
note and src/reservoir/omega_reservoir_readout.{c,h}.
note Zero host I/O, zero allocation, zero libm, zero device operations.
om2

